<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Water and Fish"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="你是水，我是鱼"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="君は水、私は魚"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="KAF"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="kaf"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="かふ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花譜"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花谱"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Transcendent Love"/><amll:meta key="album" value="深愛"/><amll:meta key="album" value="深爱"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPB602601146"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3383671949"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="000cg73c4HzXQE"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="667146778"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="5gppWMjOUk6X1ztzAi6vdK"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6764277990"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:52.280"><div begin="1.180" end="3:52.280"><p begin="1.180" end="6.350" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1.180" end="1.910">君</span><span begin="1.910" end="2.260">は</span><span begin="2.600" end="3.060">水</span><span begin="3.180" end="3.610">で</span> <span begin="3.950" end="5.010">私</span><span begin="5.010" end="5.250">は</span><span begin="5.350" end="6.350">魚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是清澈的水 而我是游鱼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是清澈的水 而我是游魚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are the water and I am the fish</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 물이고 나는 물고기</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es l&apos;eau et je suis le poisson</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres el agua y yo soy el pez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist das Wasser und ich bin der Fisch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é a água e eu sou o peixe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты вода а я рыба</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei l&apos;acqua e io sono il pesce</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa mizu de watashi wa sakana</span></p><p begin="6.780" end="11.910" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.780" end="7.510">君</span><span begin="7.510" end="7.830">は</span><span begin="8.040" end="8.200">夜</span><span begin="8.200" end="8.760">空</span><span begin="8.860" end="9.210">で</span> <span begin="9.600" end="10.630">私</span><span begin="10.630" end="10.820">は</span><span begin="10.820" end="10.920">三</span><span begin="11.000" end="11.350">日</span><span begin="11.350" end="11.910">月</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是无垠夜空 而我是弯新月</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是無垠夜空 而我是彎新月</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are the night sky and I am the crescent moon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 밤하늘이고 나는 초승달</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es le ciel nocturne et je suis le croissant de lune</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres el cielo nocturno y yo soy la luna creciente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist der Nachtsky und ich bin die Sichel des Mondes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é o céu noturno e eu sou a lua crescente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты ночное небо а я молодой месяц</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei il cielo notturno e io sono la falce di luna</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa yozora de watashi wa mikazuki</span></p><p begin="12.350" end="17.500" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.350" end="13.070">君</span><span begin="13.070" end="13.340">は</span><span begin="13.590" end="14.130">太</span><span begin="14.130" end="14.820">陽</span> <span begin="15.160" end="16.200">私</span><span begin="16.200" end="16.320">は</span><span begin="16.420" end="16.580">た</span><span begin="16.580" end="16.800">ん</span><span begin="16.890" end="16.990">ぽ</span><span begin="17.130" end="17.500">ぽ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是耀眼太阳 而我是蒲公英</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是耀眼太陽 而我是蒲公英</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are the sun and I am the dandelion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 태양이고 나는 민들레</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es le soleil et je suis le pissenlit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres el sol y yo soy el diente de león</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist die Sonne ich bin der Löwenzahn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é o sol e eu sou o dente-de-leão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты солнце а я одуванчик</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei il sole e io sono il tarassaco</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa taiyou watashi wa tanpopo</span></p><p begin="17.930" end="23.160" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.930" end="18.670">君</span><span begin="18.670" end="19.000">が</span><span begin="19.240" end="19.410">い</span><span begin="19.410" end="19.680">る</span><span begin="19.760" end="20.040">か</span><span begin="20.040" end="20.500">ら</span><span begin="20.810" end="21.840">私</span><span begin="21.840" end="22.030">は</span><span begin="22.030" end="22.120">生</span><span begin="22.210" end="22.430">き</span><span begin="22.580" end="22.840">て</span><span begin="22.840" end="23.160">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因为有你存在 我才得以存活</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">正因為有你存在 我才得以存活</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because you are here I am alive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 있기에 나는 살아가고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C&apos;est parce que tu es là que je vis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque tú estás aquí yo estoy viva</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weil du da bist lebe ich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque você existe eu estou viva</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я живу лишь потому что ты есть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Poiché tu ci sei io sono viva</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi ga iru kara watashi wa ikiteru</span></p><p begin="35.580" end="38.150" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.580" end="35.920">君</span><span begin="35.920" end="36.000">は</span><span begin="36.080" end="36.360">空</span><span begin="36.450" end="36.720">気</span> <span begin="37.020" end="37.360">君</span><span begin="37.360" end="37.440">は</span><span begin="37.520" end="37.790">大</span><span begin="37.900" end="38.150">気</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是呼吸的空气 你是包容的大气</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是呼吸的空氣 你是包容的大氣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are the air you are the atmosphere</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 공기 너는 대기</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es l&apos;air tu es l&apos;atmosphère</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres el aire tú eres la atmósfera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist die Luft du bist die Atmosphäre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é o ar você é a atmosfera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты воздух ты атмосфера</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei l&apos;aria tu sei l&apos;atmosfera</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa kuuki kimi wa taiki</span></p><p begin="38.400" end="40.940" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.400" end="38.890">私</span><span begin="38.890" end="39.110">は</span><span begin="39.110" end="39.600">光</span><span begin="39.600" end="39.740">で</span><span begin="39.740" end="40.150">音</span><span begin="40.150" end="40.290">で</span><span begin="40.290" end="40.510">ニュー</span><span begin="40.650" end="40.940">トン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我便是那光芒 那声音 还有探求的牛顿</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我便是那光芒 那聲音 還有探求的牛頓</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I am the light the sound and Newton</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 빛이자 소리이자 만유인력</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je suis la lumière le son et Newton</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo soy la luz soy el sonido soy Newton</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich bin das Licht der Klang und Newton</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu sou a luz o som e Newton</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">А я свет и звук и Ньютон</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io sono la luce il suono e Newton</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi wa hikari de oto de nyuuton</span></p><p begin="41.210" end="42.340" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.210" end="41.560">君</span><span begin="41.560" end="41.720">は</span><span begin="41.720" end="41.940">ラ</span><span begin="41.940" end="42.100">イ</span><span begin="42.100" end="42.340">オン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是威严的狮子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是威嚴的獅子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are the lion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 사자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es le lion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres el león</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist der Löwe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é o leão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты лев</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei il leone</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa raion</span></p><p begin="42.580" end="45.470" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.580" end="43.070">私</span><span begin="43.070" end="43.260">わ</span><span begin="43.260" end="43.440">ん</span><span begin="43.440" end="43.660">わ</span><span begin="43.660" end="43.810">ん</span> <span begin="43.810" end="44.150">にゃ</span><span begin="44.150" end="44.500">ん</span><span begin="44.500" end="44.810">にゃ</span><span begin="44.810" end="45.470">ん</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是小狗汪汪 小猫喵喵</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我就是小狗汪汪 小貓喵喵</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I am woof woof meow meow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 멍멍 야옹야옹</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et moi ouaf-ouaf miaou-miaou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo hago guau guau miau miau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich bin wau-wau miau-miau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu sou o au-au o miau-miau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">А я словно щенок и котёнок</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E io faccio bau bau miao miao</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi wanwan nyannyan</span></p><p begin="45.890" end="56.150" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.890" end="46.230">泣</span><span begin="46.230" end="46.470">い</span><span begin="46.590" end="46.890">て</span><span begin="47.290" end="47.990">も</span><span begin="47.990" end="49.360">笑</span><span begin="49.360" end="50.410">っ</span><span begin="50.410" end="50.700">て</span><span begin="50.700" end="51.100">も</span> <span begin="51.490" end="52.030">ね</span><span begin="52.180" end="52.590">え</span> <span begin="53.140" end="54.100">君</span><span begin="54.220" end="54.510">が</span><span begin="54.590" end="54.720">好</span><span begin="54.840" end="56.150">き</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论是哭是笑 呐 我都好喜欢你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論是哭是笑 吶 我都好喜歡你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Whether crying or laughing hey I love you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">울어도 웃어도 있지 나 네가 좋아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que je pleure ou que je rie dis je t&apos;aime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya sea llorando o riendo oye me gustas tú</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ob ich weine oder lache hey ich liebe dich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Chorando ou sorrindo ei eu amo você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Плачу ли я или смеюсь эй ты мне нравишься</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che io pianga o che io rida ehi tu mi piaci</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Naite mo waratte mo nee kimi ga suki</span></p><p begin="57.340" end="1:02.420" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.340" end="58.090">縛</span><span begin="58.090" end="58.300">り</span><span begin="58.440" end="58.660">た</span><span begin="58.780" end="59.050">く</span><span begin="59.180" end="59.410">な</span><span begin="59.410" end="59.580">い</span> <span begin="1:00.180" end="1:00.390">失</span><span begin="1:00.510" end="1:00.760">く</span><span begin="1:00.860" end="1:01.130">し</span><span begin="1:01.220" end="1:01.470">た</span><span begin="1:01.560" end="1:01.790">く</span><span begin="1:01.930" end="1:02.280">な</span><span begin="1:02.280" end="1:02.420">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不想将你束缚 却也不想将你失去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不想將你束縛 卻也不想將你失去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I don&apos;t want to bind you I don&apos;t want to lose you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">얽매고 싶지 않아 잃어버리고 싶지 않아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne veux pas t&apos;attacher je ne veux pas te perdre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No quiero atarte no quiero perderte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich will dich nicht fesseln ich will dich nicht verlieren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não quero te prender não quero te perder</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не хочу связывать тебя не хочу терять тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non voglio legarti non voglio perderti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shibaritakunai nakushitakunai</span></p><p begin="1:02.950" end="1:07.390" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.950" end="1:03.190">自</span><span begin="1:03.190" end="1:03.550">由</span><span begin="1:03.660" end="1:03.870">で</span><span begin="1:03.870" end="1:03.950">い</span><span begin="1:04.030" end="1:04.280">て</span> <span begin="1:04.360" end="1:04.590">で</span><span begin="1:04.590" end="1:04.720">も</span><span begin="1:04.720" end="1:04.940">行</span><span begin="1:05.030" end="1:05.400">か</span><span begin="1:05.400" end="1:05.760">な</span><span begin="1:05.760" end="1:06.090">い</span><span begin="1:06.090" end="1:07.390">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请保持你的自由 但也不要离我而去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請保持你的自由 但也不要離我而去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Please stay free but don&apos;t go away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">자유롭게 있어줘 하지만 떠나진 마</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Reste libre mais ne t&apos;en va pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mantén tu libertad pero no te vayas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sei frei aber geh bitte nicht fort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mantenha-se livre mas não vá embora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Будь свободным но прошу не уходи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Resta libero ma non te ne andare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jiyuu de ite demo ikanaide</span></p><p begin="1:08.860" end="1:14.170" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.860" end="1:09.560">君</span><span begin="1:09.560" end="1:09.840">は</span><span begin="1:09.920" end="1:10.520">コン</span><span begin="1:10.630" end="1:10.940">パ</span><span begin="1:10.940" end="1:11.220">ス</span><span begin="1:11.220" end="1:11.470">で</span> <span begin="1:11.690" end="1:12.350">君</span><span begin="1:12.350" end="1:12.680">は</span><span begin="1:12.680" end="1:13.320">サー</span><span begin="1:13.400" end="1:13.650">チ</span><span begin="1:13.650" end="1:13.780">ラ</span><span begin="1:13.780" end="1:14.010">イ</span><span begin="1:14.010" end="1:14.170">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是引路的罗盘 你是照亮的探照灯</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是引路的羅盤 你是照亮的探照燈</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are the compass and you are the searchlight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 나침반이고 너는 탐조등</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es la boussole et tu es le projecteur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres la brújula y tú eres el reflector</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist der Kompass du bist das Suchlicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é a bússola e você é o holofote</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты компас ты прожектор</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei la bussola e tu sei il riflettore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa konpasu de kimi wa saachiraito</span></p><p begin="1:14.490" end="1:19.780" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.490" end="1:15.170">君</span><span begin="1:15.170" end="1:15.410">は</span><span begin="1:15.520" end="1:16.180">マ</span><span begin="1:16.180" end="1:16.530">ン</span><span begin="1:16.530" end="1:16.790">ト</span><span begin="1:16.790" end="1:17.020">で</span> <span begin="1:17.290" end="1:18.320">私</span><span begin="1:18.320" end="1:18.990">は</span><span begin="1:18.990" end="1:19.370">旅</span><span begin="1:19.370" end="1:19.780">人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是避风的斗篷 而我是远行的旅人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是避風的斗篷 而我是遠行的旅人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are the cloak and I am the traveler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 망토이고 나는 나그네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es le manteau et je suis le voyageur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres la capa y yo soy la viajera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist der Mantel und ich bin der Reisende</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é a capa e eu sou a viajante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты плащ а я путник</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei il mantello e io sono la viaggiatrice</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa manto de watashi wa tabibito</span></p><p begin="1:20.060" end="1:25.320" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.060" end="1:20.760">風</span><span begin="1:20.760" end="1:21.070">と</span><span begin="1:21.070" end="1:21.800">さ</span><span begin="1:21.800" end="1:22.020">ざ</span><span begin="1:22.130" end="1:22.580">波</span> <span begin="1:22.870" end="1:23.770">水面</span><span begin="1:23.890" end="1:24.560">と</span><span begin="1:24.560" end="1:25.320">光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如清风与微澜 如水面与流光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如清風與微瀾 如水面與流光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The wind and ripples the water surface and light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">바람과 잔물결 수면과 빛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le vent et les rides de l&apos;eau la surface et la lumière</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El viento y las olas la superficie del agua y la luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Wind und die kleinen Wellen die Wasseroberfläche und das Licht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O vento e as pequenas ondas a superfície da água e a luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ветер и мелкая рябь водная гладь и свет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il vento e le increspature la superficie dell&apos;acqua e la luce</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kaze to sazanami minamo to hikari</span></p><p begin="1:25.490" end="1:31.140" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.490" end="1:25.570">好</span><span begin="1:25.650" end="1:25.920">き</span><span begin="1:26.020" end="1:26.160">に</span><span begin="1:26.250" end="1:26.460">な</span><span begin="1:26.460" end="1:26.600">っ</span><span begin="1:26.600" end="1:26.810">た</span><span begin="1:26.890" end="1:27.410">瞬</span><span begin="1:27.410" end="1:27.760">間</span><span begin="1:27.760" end="1:27.990">か</span><span begin="1:27.990" end="1:28.080">ら</span><span begin="1:28.160" end="1:28.570">全</span><span begin="1:28.570" end="1:31.140">部</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从坠入爱河的那一瞬间起 一切的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">從墜入愛河的那一瞬間起 一切的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">From the very moment I fell in love everything</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑에 빠진 그 순간부터 전부</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Depuis l&apos;instant où je suis tombée amoureuse tout</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Desde el instante en que me enamoré todo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ab dem Moment in dem ich mich verliebt habe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desde o momento em que me apaixonei tudo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">С самого мгновения как я влюбилась всё это</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dal momento esatto in cui mi sono innamorata tutto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Suki ni natta shunkan kara zenbu</span></p><p begin="1:32.420" end="1:33.990" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.420" end="1:32.540">負</span><span begin="1:32.620" end="1:32.870">け</span><span begin="1:33.000" end="1:33.360">だ</span><span begin="1:33.360" end="1:33.560">っ</span><span begin="1:33.560" end="1:33.730">た</span><span begin="1:33.810" end="1:33.990">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便注定是我的丢盔弃甲</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">便注定是我的丟盔棄甲</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Was a defeat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나의 패배였어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">N&apos;était qu&apos;une défaite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya estaba perdido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">War alles eine Niederlage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Foi uma derrota</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Было моим поражением</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È stato una sconfitta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Make datta no</span></p><p begin="1:45.340" end="1:47.890" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.340" end="1:45.560">そ</span><span begin="1:45.560" end="1:45.780">れ</span><span begin="1:45.780" end="1:45.920">は</span><span begin="1:45.920" end="1:46.250">青</span><span begin="1:46.250" end="1:46.490">で</span> <span begin="1:46.800" end="1:46.950">た</span><span begin="1:46.950" end="1:47.190">ま</span><span begin="1:47.190" end="1:47.310">に</span><span begin="1:47.310" end="1:47.660">赤</span><span begin="1:47.660" end="1:47.890">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那份情感起初是蓝色的 偶尔也会变成红色</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那份情感起初是藍色的 偶爾也會變成紅色</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That is blue and occasionally red</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그것은 푸른색 때로는 붉은색</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C&apos;est du bleu et parfois du rouge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Eso era azul y a veces rojo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es war blau und manchmal rot</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Aquilo era azul e às vezes vermelho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Оно синее а иногда красное</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo sentimento è blu e a volte rosso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore wa ao de tamani aka de</span></p><p begin="1:48.210" end="1:50.690" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.210" end="1:48.860">紫</span><span begin="1:48.860" end="1:49.040">オ</span><span begin="1:49.040" end="1:49.210">レ</span><span begin="1:49.210" end="1:49.350">ン</span><span begin="1:49.350" end="1:49.570">ジ</span><span begin="1:49.570" end="1:49.920">白</span><span begin="1:49.920" end="1:50.040">グ</span><span begin="1:50.040" end="1:50.330">レー</span><span begin="1:50.430" end="1:50.690">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紫色 橙色 白色 灰色 交织在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">紫色 橙色 白色 灰色 交織在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">With purple orange white and grey</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">보라 주황 하얗고 잿빛으로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un mélange de violet d&apos;orange de blanc et de gris</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Entrelazado con morado naranja blanco y gris</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Violett orange weiß und grau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Roxo laranja branco e cinza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Фиолетовое оранжевое белое и серое</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un insieme di viola arancione bianco e grigio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Murasaki orenji shiro guree de</span></p><p begin="1:50.970" end="1:55.110" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.970" end="1:51.110">混</span><span begin="1:51.110" end="1:51.340">ざ</span><span begin="1:51.340" end="1:51.500">り</span><span begin="1:51.500" end="1:51.660">合</span><span begin="1:51.660" end="1:51.850">っ</span><span begin="1:51.850" end="1:52.090">て</span> <span begin="1:52.520" end="1:52.700">い</span><span begin="1:52.700" end="1:52.850">ず</span><span begin="1:52.850" end="1:53.070">れ</span><span begin="1:53.170" end="1:53.780">黒</span><span begin="1:53.920" end="1:54.110">に</span><span begin="1:54.250" end="1:54.610">な</span><span begin="1:54.610" end="1:55.110">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相互融合 最终定格成了黑色</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">相互融合 最終定格成了黑色</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Mixing together it will eventually turn black</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">서로 뒤섞여 언젠가는 검은색이 돼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Qui finit par se mêler pour devenir du noir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mezclándose para convertirse finalmente en negro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ineinanderfließend wird es irgendwann zu Schwarz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Misturando-se até que um dia se tornará preto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Смешиваясь они в конце концов станут чёрным</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che mescolandosi un giorno diventerà nero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mazariatte izure kuro ni naru</span></p><p begin="1:55.640" end="2:00.990" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.640" end="1:56.030">綺</span><span begin="1:56.030" end="1:56.670">麗</span><span begin="1:57.050" end="1:57.650">な</span><span begin="1:57.770" end="1:58.340">ま</span><span begin="1:58.460" end="1:58.790">ま</span><span begin="1:58.790" end="1:59.160">い</span><span begin="1:59.160" end="2:00.050">れ</span><span begin="2:00.210" end="2:00.620">な</span><span begin="2:00.620" end="2:00.990">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再也无法保持最初那种毫无杂质的纯洁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">再也無法保持最初那種毫無雜質的純潔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Unable to stay beautiful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아름다운 채로만 남을 수는 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Impossible de rester pure et belle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No puedo permanecer pura y hermosa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Man kann nicht rein bleiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não dá para continuar linda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Невозможно вечно оставаться чистой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non si può rimanere puri e immacolati</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kirei na mama irenai</span></p><p begin="2:01.520" end="2:05.970" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.520" end="2:01.770">け</span><span begin="2:01.930" end="2:02.310">ど</span> <span begin="2:02.920" end="2:03.320">そ</span><span begin="2:03.320" end="2:03.570">れ</span><span begin="2:03.710" end="2:03.970">も</span><span begin="2:04.080" end="2:04.390">い</span><span begin="2:04.390" end="2:04.560">い</span><span begin="2:04.660" end="2:05.970">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过 这样似乎也不赖呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不過 這樣似乎也不賴呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">But that is fine too</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하지만 그것도 나쁘지 않네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais c&apos;est très bien ainsi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero eso también está bien verdad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Aber das ist auch gut so nicht wahr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas tudo bem assim também né</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но ведь это тоже прекрасно не так ли</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma va bene anche così</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kedo sore mo ii ne</span></p><p begin="2:07.160" end="2:09.280" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.160" end="2:07.590">知</span><span begin="2:07.590" end="2:07.850">っ</span><span begin="2:07.850" end="2:08.070">て</span><span begin="2:08.220" end="2:08.400">ま</span><span begin="2:08.510" end="2:08.730">す</span><span begin="2:08.880" end="2:09.250">か</span><span begin="2:09.250" end="2:09.280">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否知晓呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是否知曉呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Did you know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">알고 계시나요</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le savez-vous ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sabías esto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weißt du es?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você sabia?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Знаешь ли ты об этом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lo sapevi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shittemasu ka?</span></p><p begin="2:09.930" end="2:17.180" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.930" end="2:10.460">水</span><span begin="2:10.640" end="2:10.850">と</span><span begin="2:10.930" end="2:12.160">魚</span> <span begin="2:12.600" end="2:12.720">二</span><span begin="2:12.720" end="2:13.090">千</span><span begin="2:13.090" end="2:13.430">年</span><span begin="2:13.430" end="2:13.700">前</span><span begin="2:13.780" end="2:14.010">か</span><span begin="2:14.010" end="2:14.120">ら</span><span begin="2:14.120" end="2:14.470">想</span><span begin="2:14.470" end="2:14.810">い</span><span begin="2:14.810" end="2:15.180">合</span><span begin="2:15.180" end="2:15.510">っ</span><span begin="2:15.510" end="2:15.870">て</span><span begin="2:15.870" end="2:17.180">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">水与游鱼 早在两千年前便已倾心相爱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">水與游魚 早在兩千年前便已傾心相愛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Water and fish have been longing for each other since two thousand years ago</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">물과 물고기는 이천 년 전부터 서로를 그리워했다는 걸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L&apos;eau et le poisson s&apos;aimaient déjà il y a deux mille ans</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El agua y el pez se han amado desde hace dos mil años</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wasser und Fisch sehnen sich schon seit zweitausend Jahren nacheinander</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A água e o peixe se amavam desde dois mil anos atrás</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вода и рыба тосковали друг по другу ещё две тысячи лет назад</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L&apos;acqua e il pesce si amano già da duemila anni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mizu to sakana nisennen mae kara omoiatteta</span></p><p begin="2:18.640" end="2:23.980" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.640" end="2:19.340">君</span><span begin="2:19.340" end="2:19.690">は</span><span begin="2:19.690" end="2:20.390">文</span><span begin="2:20.390" end="2:21.000">学</span><span begin="2:21.000" end="2:21.230">で</span><span begin="2:21.470" end="2:22.160">絵</span><span begin="2:22.160" end="2:22.520">画</span><span begin="2:22.520" end="2:23.210">で</span><span begin="2:23.210" end="2:23.520">音</span><span begin="2:23.520" end="2:23.980">楽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是传世的文学 是绝美的绘画 是动听的音乐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是傳世的文學 是絕美的繪畫 是動聽的音樂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are literature painting and music</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 문학이자 회화이자 음악</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es la littérature la peinture la musique</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres la literatura la pintura y la música</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist die Literatur das Gemälde die Musik</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é a literatura a pintura e a música</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты литература живопись и музыка</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei la letteratura la pittura la musica</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa bungaku de kaiga de ongaku</span></p><p begin="2:24.270" end="2:29.570" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.270" end="2:24.580">ア</span><span begin="2:24.580" end="2:24.920">ガ</span><span begin="2:24.920" end="2:25.300">サ</span><span begin="2:25.300" end="2:25.920">で</span><span begin="2:26.000" end="2:26.220">ゴ</span><span begin="2:26.220" end="2:26.300">ッ</span><span begin="2:26.300" end="2:26.560">ホ</span><span begin="2:26.560" end="2:26.760">で</span><span begin="2:27.030" end="2:27.270">ショ</span><span begin="2:27.370" end="2:27.740">パ</span><span begin="2:27.740" end="2:28.060">ン</span><span begin="2:28.060" end="2:28.680">で</span><span begin="2:28.760" end="2:29.120">孔</span><span begin="2:29.120" end="2:29.570">明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是阿加莎 是梵高 是肖邦 是算无遗策的孔明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">是阿加莎 是梵高 是肖邦 是算無遺策的孔明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Agatha and Van Gogh and Chopin and Kongming</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아가사이고 고흐이자 쇼팽이자 제갈공명</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es Agatha tu es Van Gogh tu es Chopin tu es Kongming</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Eres Agatha eres Van Gogh eres Chopin y eres Kongming</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Agatha und Van Gogh und Chopin und Kongming</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Agatha Van Gogh Chopin e Zhuge Liang</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты Агата Ван Гог Шопен и Кунмин</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sei Agatha sei Van Gogh sei Chopin sei Zhuge Liang</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Agasa de gohho de shopan de koumei</span></p><p begin="2:29.830" end="2:35.150" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.830" end="2:30.520">君</span><span begin="2:30.520" end="2:30.880">が</span><span begin="2:30.880" end="2:32.150">私</span><span begin="2:32.150" end="2:32.380">を</span><span begin="2:32.640" end="2:33.330">描</span><span begin="2:33.330" end="2:33.600">い</span><span begin="2:33.710" end="2:34.380">ちゃ</span><span begin="2:34.380" end="2:34.690">う</span><span begin="2:34.690" end="2:34.950">か</span><span begin="2:34.950" end="2:35.150">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因为你在你的世界里将我勾勒描绘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">正因為你在你的世界裡將我勾勒描繪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because you end up drawing me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 나를 그려버리니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Puisque c&apos;est toi qui me dessines</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Debido a que tú terminas dibujándome</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weil du mich zeichnest</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque você acaba me desenhando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Раз уж ты сам рисуешь меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Poiché sei tu a dipingere me</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi ga watashi o egaichau kara</span></p><p begin="2:35.270" end="2:40.900" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.270" end="2:35.460">ピ</span><span begin="2:35.460" end="2:35.680">ア</span><span begin="2:35.790" end="2:36.020">ノ</span><span begin="2:36.020" end="2:36.190">の</span><span begin="2:36.190" end="2:36.520">上</span> <span begin="2:36.700" end="2:37.030">踊</span><span begin="2:37.030" end="2:37.180">れ</span><span begin="2:37.180" end="2:37.370">も</span><span begin="2:37.370" end="2:37.540">し</span><span begin="2:37.540" end="2:37.740">な</span><span begin="2:37.740" end="2:37.920">い</span><span begin="2:37.920" end="2:38.160">ワ</span><span begin="2:38.160" end="2:38.270">ル</span><span begin="2:38.400" end="2:40.900">ツ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我才不得不在琴键之上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我才不得不在琴鍵之上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">On top of the piano a waltz I cannot even dance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">피아노 위에서 춤추지도 못할 왈츠춤을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sur le piano cette valse que je ne sais même pas danser</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sobre el piano un vals que ni siquiera sé bailar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auf dem Klavier bin ich wohl dazu verdammt einen Walzer zu tanzen den ich gar nicht beherrsche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sobre o piano uma valsa que nem sei dançar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">То на клавишах пианино этот вальс который я даже не умею танцевать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sul pianoforte un valzer che non so nemmeno ballare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Piano no ue odore mo shinai warutsu</span></p><p begin="2:42.200" end="2:44.000" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.200" end="2:42.600">踊</span><span begin="2:42.600" end="2:42.760">る</span><span begin="2:42.760" end="2:42.970">羽</span><span begin="2:42.970" end="2:43.110">目</span><span begin="2:43.110" end="2:43.230">に</span><span begin="2:43.340" end="2:43.500">な</span><span begin="2:43.500" end="2:43.770">る</span><span begin="2:43.770" end="2:44.000">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跳起这原本根本不会跳的圆舞曲</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">跳起這原本根本不會跳的圓舞曲</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I end up having to dance it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">기어이 추게 되고 마는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je me retrouve condamnée à la danser</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Termino teniendo que bailarlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich muss ihn einfach tanzen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Acabo sendo fadada a dançar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мне суждено станцевать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi ritrovo costretta a danzarlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Odoru hame ni naru no</span></p><p begin="3:04.660" end="3:10.070" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:04.660" end="3:05.410">君</span><span begin="3:05.410" end="3:05.630">は</span><span begin="3:05.770" end="3:06.800">毛</span><span begin="3:06.800" end="3:07.050">布</span><span begin="3:07.050" end="3:07.270">で</span> <span begin="3:07.530" end="3:08.190">君</span><span begin="3:08.190" end="3:08.440">は</span><span begin="3:08.540" end="3:09.080">子</span><span begin="3:09.240" end="3:09.440">守</span><span begin="3:09.440" end="3:09.580">り</span><span begin="3:09.580" end="3:10.070">唄</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是温暖的毛毯 你是轻柔的摇篮曲</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是溫暖的毛毯 你是輕柔的搖籃曲</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are the blanket and you are the lullaby</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 담요이고 너는 자장가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es la couverture et tu es la berceuse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres la manta y tú eres la canción de cuna</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist die Decke du bist das Wiegenlied</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é o cobertor e você é a canção de ninar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты одеяло ты колыбельная</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei la coperta e tu sei la ninnananna</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa moufu de kimi wa komoriuta</span></p><p begin="3:10.330" end="3:15.650" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:10.330" end="3:11.020">眠</span><span begin="3:11.020" end="3:11.240">れ</span><span begin="3:11.370" end="3:11.950">な</span><span begin="3:11.950" end="3:12.070">い</span><span begin="3:12.070" end="3:12.630">夜</span><span begin="3:12.630" end="3:12.820">の</span><span begin="3:13.150" end="3:13.440">ぬ</span><span begin="3:13.440" end="3:13.790">る</span><span begin="3:13.790" end="3:14.110">い</span><span begin="3:14.110" end="3:14.420">ホ</span><span begin="3:14.420" end="3:14.810">ッ</span><span begin="3:14.810" end="3:14.970">ト</span><span begin="3:15.050" end="3:15.170">ミ</span><span begin="3:15.170" end="3:15.320">ル</span><span begin="3:15.420" end="3:15.650">ク</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是无眠之夜里 那杯温热的纯牛奶</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">是無眠之夜裡 那杯溫熱的純牛奶</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The lukewarm hot milk on sleepless nights</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잠들지 못하는 밤의 미지근하고 따뜻한 우유</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce lait chaud et tiède des nuits sans sommeil</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La tibia leche con miel en las noches de insomnio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die lauwarme heiße Milch in schlaflosen Nächten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O leite quente e morno na noite sem dormir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тёплое молоко в бессонную ночную пору</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il tiepido latte caldo nelle notti insonni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nemurenai yoru no nurui hotto miruku</span></p><p begin="3:15.910" end="3:21.230" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:15.910" end="3:16.810">私</span><span begin="3:16.940" end="3:17.610">も</span><span begin="3:17.610" end="3:18.010">そ</span><span begin="3:18.010" end="3:18.240">う</span><span begin="3:18.240" end="3:18.450">で</span><span begin="3:18.680" end="3:19.040">あ</span><span begin="3:19.040" end="3:19.290">り</span><span begin="3:19.380" end="3:19.640">た</span><span begin="3:19.720" end="3:20.430">か</span><span begin="3:20.430" end="3:20.780">っ</span><span begin="3:20.780" end="3:21.030">た</span><span begin="3:21.030" end="3:21.230">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经的我也好想 成为你这样的存在啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">曾經的我也好想 成為你這樣的存在啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I wanted to be like that too</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나도 네게 그런 존재이고 싶었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;aurais tant voulu être ainsi pour toi moi aussi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo también deseaba ser eso para ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Genauso wollte ich auch für dich sein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu também queria ter sido assim para você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я ведь тоже так хотела стать для тебя всем этим</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche io avrei voluto essere così per te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi mo sou de aritakatta no</span></p><p begin="3:21.470" end="3:25.670" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:21.470" end="3:22.080">浅</span><span begin="3:22.160" end="3:22.490">き</span><span begin="3:22.490" end="3:23.490">夢</span><span begin="3:23.570" end="3:23.800">見</span><span begin="3:23.800" end="3:24.030">し</span> <span begin="3:24.120" end="3:24.470">水</span><span begin="3:24.610" end="3:24.730">と</span><span begin="3:24.810" end="3:25.670">魚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">浮生若梦 终是一场水与游鱼的羁绊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">浮生若夢 終是一場水與游魚的羈絆</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Having shallow dreams water and fish</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">덧없는 꿈을 꾸는 물과 물고기</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un rêve éphémère l&apos;eau et le poisson</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Teniendo un sueño efímero el agua y el pez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein flüchtiger Traum von Wasser und Fisch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tendo sonhos rasos a água e o peixe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Видящие мимолётные сны вода и рыба</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un sogno effimero l&apos;acqua e il pesce</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Asaki yume mishi mizu to sakana</span></p><p begin="3:27.020" end="3:32.370" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:27.020" end="3:27.720">君</span><span begin="3:27.720" end="3:28.070">は</span><span begin="3:28.070" end="3:28.610">コン</span><span begin="3:28.760" end="3:29.090">パ</span><span begin="3:29.090" end="3:29.380">ス</span><span begin="3:29.380" end="3:29.610">で</span> <span begin="3:29.840" end="3:30.520">君</span><span begin="3:30.520" end="3:30.860">は</span><span begin="3:30.860" end="3:31.500">サー</span><span begin="3:31.580" end="3:31.810">チ</span><span begin="3:31.810" end="3:31.950">ラ</span><span begin="3:31.950" end="3:32.160">イ</span><span begin="3:32.160" end="3:32.370">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是引路的罗盘 你是照亮的探照灯</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是引路的羅盤 你是照亮的探照燈</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are the compass and you are the searchlight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 나침반이고 너는 탐조등</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es la boussole et tu es le projecteur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres la brújula y tú eres el reflector</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist der Kompass du bist das Suchlicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é a bússola e você é o holofote</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты компас ты прожектор</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei la bussola e tu sei il riflettore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa konpasu de kimi wa saachiraito</span></p><p begin="3:32.630" end="3:37.930" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:32.630" end="3:33.280">君</span><span begin="3:33.280" end="3:33.530">は</span><span begin="3:33.630" end="3:34.360">マ</span><span begin="3:34.360" end="3:34.690">ン</span><span begin="3:34.690" end="3:34.930">ト</span><span begin="3:34.930" end="3:35.180">で</span> <span begin="3:35.420" end="3:36.450">私</span><span begin="3:36.450" end="3:37.150">は</span><span begin="3:37.150" end="3:37.510">旅</span><span begin="3:37.510" end="3:37.930">人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是避风的斗篷 而我是远行的旅人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是避風的斗篷 而我是遠行的旅人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are the cloak and I am the traveler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 망토이고 나는 나그네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es le manteau et je suis le voyageur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres la capa y yo soy la viajera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist der Mantel und ich bin der Reisende</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é a capa e eu sou a viajante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты плащ а я путник</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei il mantello e io sono la viaggiatrice</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa manto de watashi wa tabibito</span></p><p begin="3:38.210" end="3:43.450" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:38.210" end="3:38.840">風</span><span begin="3:38.920" end="3:39.150">と</span><span begin="3:39.230" end="3:39.940">さ</span><span begin="3:39.940" end="3:40.170">ざ</span><span begin="3:40.290" end="3:40.800">波</span> <span begin="3:41.010" end="3:41.920">水面</span><span begin="3:42.050" end="3:42.700">と</span><span begin="3:42.700" end="3:43.450">光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如清风与微澜 如水面与流光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如清風與微瀾 如水面與流光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The wind and ripples the water surface and light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">바람과 잔물결 수면과 빛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le vent et les rides de l&apos;eau la surface et la lumière</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El viento y las olas la superficie del agua y la luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Wind und die kleinen Wellen die Wasseroberfläche und das Licht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O vento e as pequenas ondas a superfície da água e a luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ветер и мелкая рябь водная гладь и свет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il vento e le increspature la superficie dell&apos;acqua e la luce</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kaze to sazanami minamo to hikari</span></p><p begin="3:43.650" end="3:49.290" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:43.650" end="3:43.820">好</span><span begin="3:43.820" end="3:44.060">き</span><span begin="3:44.140" end="3:44.280">に</span><span begin="3:44.360" end="3:44.580">な</span><span begin="3:44.580" end="3:44.710">っ</span><span begin="3:44.710" end="3:44.940">た</span><span begin="3:45.020" end="3:45.550">君</span><span begin="3:45.550" end="3:45.750">に</span><span begin="3:45.750" end="3:45.860">見</span><span begin="3:45.860" end="3:46.100">せ</span><span begin="3:46.100" end="3:46.240">た</span><span begin="3:46.240" end="3:46.640">全</span><span begin="3:46.640" end="3:49.290">部</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将那个满心欢喜爱上你的我 展现给你的全部</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將那個滿心歡喜愛上你的我 展現給你的全部</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Everything I showed to you whom I fell in love with</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑하게 된 네게 보여준 전부</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout ce que j&apos;ai montré à toi que j&apos;ai commencé à aimer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo lo que te mostré a ti de quien me enamoré</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Alles was ich dir gezeigt habe als ich mich in dich verliebt hatte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tudo o que mostrei a você por quem me apaixonei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всё то что я показала тебе когда полюбила</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tutto ciò che ho mostrato a te che ho iniziato ad amare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Suki ni natta kimi ni miseta zenbu</span></p><p begin="3:50.640" end="3:52.280" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:50.640" end="3:51.100">愛</span><span begin="3:51.210" end="3:51.570">だ</span><span begin="3:51.570" end="3:51.750">っ</span><span begin="3:51.750" end="3:51.910">た</span><span begin="3:52.040" end="3:52.280">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实都是我毫无保留的爱啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">其實都是我毫無保留的愛啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Was love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그건 사랑이었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">N&apos;était que de l&apos;amour</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo era amor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es war reine Liebe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Era amor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это и было моей любовью</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Era amore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ai datta no</span></p></div></body></tt>